  "prefLabel": "Bal 105.01 Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bal 105.01 Meetings. The commission shall meet as required by statute, and at such additional time as are called for by the chairman or by vote of the commission. In case any member of the commission is absent from any meeting or unable to perform his or her duties or disqualifies himself or herself as commissioner, an alternate member who shall have the same qualification as those of the commissioner whose place he is temporarily filling shall perform the duties of commissioner. In an emergency or with the consent of the consent of the parties involved 2 commissioners may act on behalf of the commission.\n\nSource. #6262, eff 6-7-96",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bal100-600.html"
